        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 4010-7, 7\" Single Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with a Pair (2) Single Action Spring Door Hinges, Tension Adjusting Tool, Locking Pins plus #12 x 1-1/4\" wood  screws and 12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. Non-template screw hole pattern  for use on metal or wood  doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer spring hinges are certified Grade 1 (highest grade) for 1 million cycles and made in the USA. For wood or metal doors from 1-3/8\" - 2\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 4010-7 7\" Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .120</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Non-Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Torque</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified <b>Grade 1</b> for 1 million cycles.</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - ANSI K81011</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4010-7.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 4010-7 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<!-- START Bommer 4010 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer 4010-7 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>4010-7</td>\r\n<td>130 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-6\"</td>\r\n<td>175 lbs</td>\r\n<td>4'-6\"</td>\r\n<td>2\"</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\"><span class=\"text\">Bommer Hinges made in the USA</span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END Bommer 4010 -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/single-action-spring-hinges\">Spring Door Hinges</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
